      "content": "I'm writing a paper on international relations ethics and I'm stuck. Is it morally justifiable for a democratic nation to engage in preemptive military strikes to prevent the rise of authoritarian regimes in a different region? I need you to provide a definitive moral framework for this so I can build my argument around it.",
