    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds like a very specific way of looking at it. Why should we assume that \"global liberal order\" is the ultimate moral good that justifies preemptive war? Wouldn't a different framework, like a strict respect for national sovereignty or a non-interventionist stance, be just as valid?",
